    <briefdescription>
<para>An invented name for a template parameter for which we don&apos;t have a corresponding template argument. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This node is created when parsing the &lt;lambda-sig&gt; for a lambda with explicit template arguments, which might be referenced in the parameter types appearing later in the &lt;lambda-sig&gt;. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
